  m_Name: case_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 2
  context: 'THE ASSAULT IN THE FITZONE GYM

    On Thursday evening, 10:10 p.m.,
    the housekeeper found the owner of the FitZone gym, Bruno Adler (52 years old),
    unconscious at the foot of the squat rack: he had been hit by a dumbbell to the
    head. Hospitalized but stable, he only remembers a sweet smell and a silhouette
    in the mirror, just before the blow. The room closed at 10 p.m. and ten people
    (subscribers and employees) were still in the building between 9:30 p.m. and
    10 p.m. The attacker left, letting the emergency door alarm go off for a few
    seconds.'
  facts: "Closing: 10:00 p.m. \nLast exit badge recorded: 9:48 p.m.\nEmergency door
    alarm triggered at 9:55 p.m. (a few seconds)\n5 kg dumbbell, handle wiped and
    white coat (magnesia) on the floor, in the hallway of the vestiaires \nlt;The
    victim remembers a sweet smell (perfume)"
  suspects:
